OL,5,MBIRMINGHAM SIX PROGRAMME: "NOTHING NEW"
OL,7, 106FHome Office dismisses TV evidence
OL,8, 170FPM scorns "trial by television"
OL,9, 107FTV four "were IRA officers" - Dear
OL,11, 104 NUCLEAR PARTSFIraq denies smuggling
OL,12, 103FThree charged with illegal export
OL,13, 170FHurd rejects breaking off relations
OL,14, 105FNuclear smuggling indictment in US
