OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGIRAQ REACTS ANGRILY TO
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGSMUGGLING CLAIMS
OL,4,D
OL,5, Iraq has reacted angrily to British
OL,6, allegations that Iraqis were involved
OL,7, in an attempt to smuggle nuclear bomb
OL,8, parts from the US to Baghdad.
OL,10,FThe Iraqi foreign ministry has denied
OL,11,Fthe allegations and warned that Iraq
OL,12,Fcould retaliate against actions that
OL,13,FBritain might take.
OL,15,FIraq also said the allegations were
OL,16,Fpart of an anti-Iraq campaign mounted
OL,17,Fby Britain and the "Zionists".
OL,19,FA BBC correspondent says the already
OL,20,Fstrained relations with Iraq look set
OL,21,Fto worsen further.
OL,23,D]FFromG29-03-90F/ teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
