OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGNUCLEAR SMUGGLING
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGINDICTMENT IN US
OL,4,D
OL,5, Five people and two British companies
OL,6, have been charged in a US indictment
OL,7, with conspiring to smuggle nuclear
OL,8, weaponry to Iraq.
OL,10,FThe five include Ali Ashour Daghir and
OL,11,FJeanine Speckman, who appeared in court
OL,12,Fin Britain today over the smuggling of
OL,13,Felectrical components to Iraq.
OL,15,FThe two companies named, Euromac and
OL,16,FAtlas Equipment, are both operated by
OL,17,FMr Daghir.
OL,19,FThe indictment also reveals details of
OL,20,Fan 18-month undercover operation to
OL,21,Ffoil the alleged conspiracy.
OL,23,D]FFromG29-03-90F/ teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
