OL,1,Vk4                              G11/11
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGCRIME INCREASES IN
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGENGLAND AND WALES
OL,4,D
OL,5, Home Office figures indicate a sharp
OL,6, increase in crime in England and Wales
OL,7, last year.
OL,9,FThere were 3,900,000 recorded offences
OL,10,F- an increase of 4%.
OL,11,F
OL,12,FThe figures show a 16% increase in rape
OL,13,Fand 12% rise in crimes of violence.
OL,14,FReports of gross indecency involving
OL,15,Fchildren doubled to nearly 1,300.
OL,16,F
OL,17,FA new survey of 14 countries shows
OL,18,Fthat crime rates in Britain are less
OL,19,Fthan the average, but Britons have a
OL,20,Fdisproportionately high fear of crime.
OL,21,F
OL,23,D]FFromG29-03-90F/ teletextarchive.com
